<title>BRAZIL: One CVRD injunction falls-Brazil court.</title>
<headline>One CVRD injunction falls-Brazil court.</headline>
<dateline>BRASILIA 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>A Brazilian court official confirmed that one of at least three injunctions blocking the privatization of Companhia Vale do Rio Doce (CVRD) has been overturned.</p>
<p>Government lawyers in the southern state of Rio Grande do Sul managed to have the injunction struck down, allowing the auction of 45 percent of CVRD's voting shares begun on the Rio stock exchange earlier today, the spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>The auction was suspended, however, when a court official entered the exchange, waving a fresh injunction against the sale. At least one other injunction has since been issued.</p>
</text>
